core":87.00850598102247,"landed":0.4,"crashed":0.04,"boulder":0.46,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/C/champions/g00603_s4_best.pkl","run":"C","replay":"replays/C_0027.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 11:06:41","kind":"stage_cap","gen":453,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 11:06:41","kind":"stage_start","gen":453,"stage_index":4,"stage":"boulder","expect":"Starts near 14-25% landed with full-size boulders, so ramp the size 40% -> 100% over 150 generations. Expect the longest stage; a pass at 95% may need the polish stage too.","run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 11:05:09","kind":"check_pass","gen":448,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":352.59816545772503,"score":223.55455656804278,"landed":0.95,"crashed":0.04,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.01},"confirm":{"fitness":331.5963330802467,"score":205.4661381940666,"landed":0.92,"crashed":0.08,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 11:05:07","kind":"new_best","gen":448,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":352.59816545772503,"score":223.55455656804278,"landed":0.95,"crashed":0.04,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.01},"champion":"runs/C/champions/g00448_s3_best.pkl","run":"C","replay":"replays/C_0023.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:56:13","kind":"new_best","gen":428,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":368.8763297467683,"score":243.81117995677218,"landed":0.92,"crashed":0.06,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/C/champions/g00428_s3_best.pkl","run":"C","replay":"replays/C_0022.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:53:18","kind":"new_best","gen":423,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":361.0596912686171,"score":239.01608831576704,"landed":0.92,"crashed":0.06,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.02},"champion":"runs/C/champions/g00423_s3_best.pkl","run":"C","replay":"replays/C_0021.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:50:28","title":"Gusts passed; full wind below the pilot; boulder skill missing; attempt C","text":"Gusts (no turbulence) passed at generation 202: 96% on 100 fresh flights, confirmed.\nFull wind (gusts 15 + turbulence 1.5): the best fresh check was 92% (gen 373), but that was partly selection luck. On 400 paired unseen flights the same champion lands 86.0% vs the pilot's 91.0% (-5.0 [-9.2, -0.8]). The gusts champion: 71.8%. So turbulence is the hard part of the wind, and NEAT is still below its teacher there.\nBigger problem, found by checking ahead: with the boulder, the best champion lands 14.3% and even the cloned start network only 25.0%, vs the pilot's 76.7% (300 paired flights). The boulder rules (steer beside it, stay above it) never made it into the clone.\nChange (one): attempt C resumes B's population at gen 417 and ramps the boulder size from 40% to 100% over the first half of the boulder stage, the way wind was ramped.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:49:38","kind":"run_start","gen":-1,"stage_index":3,"note":"Attempt C = B resumed from its population at gen ~412 (in the gusts + turbulence stage), with one change: the boulder stage ramps the boulder size from 40% to 100%. Why: the cloned start network only landed 25% with the boulder (pilot 77%) and B's best wind champion 14% (300 paired flights): the boulder skill was never cloned well, so it must be learned in NEAT, from small boulders up.","run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:30:10","kind":"new_best","gen":373,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":356.01069480543674,"score":228.63250240685596,"landed":0.92,"crashed":0.08,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/B/champions/g00373_s3_best.pkl","run":"B","replay":"replays/B_0019.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:30:10","kind":"new_best","gen":373,"stage_index":3,"stage":"gusts + turbulence","check":{"fitness":356.01069480543674,"score":228.63250240685596,"landed":0.92,"crashed":0.08,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/B/champions/g00373_s3_best.pkl","run":"C","replay":"replays/C_0019.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 10:23:24","kind":"new_b