ence +15.0 points [95% CI +10.7, +19.3]. NEAT beat its teacher.\nBut in the real gusty wind with turbulence the same champion lands only 64.3% vs the pilot's 92.3% (-28.0 [-34.0, -22.0]): it specialised in a constant push. The gusts stage (now running, wind ramping 5 -> 15) has to win that back. If it doesn't, the steady-push stage should be shortened or mixed with real gusts.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:44:49","kind":"check_pass","gen":76,"stage_index":1,"stage":"steady push","check":{"fitness":403.2512200739465,"score":264.90424093951054,"landed":0.99,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":388.2284383201845,"score":255.02405710072023,"landed":0.96,"crashed":0.03,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.01},"run":"B"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:44:49","kind":"stage_pass","gen":76,"stage_index":1,"stage":"steady push","check":{"fitness":403.2512200739465,"score":264.90424093951054,"landed":0.99,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":388.2284383201845,"score":255.02405710072023,"landed":0.96,"crashed":0.03,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.01},"champion":"runs/B/champions/g00076_s1_passed.pkl","run":"B","replay":"replays/B_0008.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:44:49","kind":"stage_start","gen":76,"stage_index":2,"stage":"gusts","expect":"Real gusts at full strength. The wind project's best NEAT reached ~91% with turbulence; aim 95% without.","run":"B"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:44:49","kind":"check_pass","gen":76,"stage_index":1,"stage":"steady push","check":{"fitness":403.2512200739465,"score":264.90424093951054,"landed":0.99,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":388.2284383201845,"score":255.02405710072023,"landed":0.96,"crashed":0.03,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.01},"run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:44:49","kind":"stage_pass","gen":76,"stage_index":1,"stage":"steady push","check":{"fitness":403.2512200739465,"score":264.90424093951054,"landed":0.99,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":388.2284383