n real gusts (the pilot: 84%).","run":"B"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:10:45","kind":"stage_start","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","expect":"Quick: the cloned network already lands in calm air; NEAT polishes centring. Pass within ~30 generations.","run":"B"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:10:45","kind":"run_start","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"note":"Attempt B = A with two fixes: the steady push now follows the wind ramp (in A it was always full strength), and training wheels start at 0.3, not 1.0 (the pilot landed 83% with full wheels, 84% without, 89.5% at 0.3). Steady-push pass lowered to 90%: a constant push up to 15 is harder than real gusts (the pilot: 84%).","run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:10:45","kind":"stage_start","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","expect":"Quick: the cloned network already lands in calm air; NEAT polishes centring. Pass within ~30 generations.","run":"C"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:10:45","title":"Attempt A stopped, B started: a bug and weaker training wheels","text":"Run A passed calm air at generation 5 (98% and 97% on two fresh sets of 100), but in the steady-push stage the champion fell to 72-80% landed already at 'wind 5'. Two causes, both measured with the pilot on 200 flights:\n1. A bug: the steady push ignored the wind ramp and was always 30-100% of full strength. Fixed, with a test.\n2. Training wheels at full strength hurt: the pilot landed 83% with them, 84% without, 89.5% at 0.3 strength. They stop the lander tilting to steer.\nAttempt B: wheels start at 0.3, steady-push pass at 90%. Restarted from the cloned network (stage 1 took only 3 minutes).","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:00:46","kind":"check_pass","gen":5,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","check":{"fitness":409.4703361799543,"score":265.59501909273905,"landed":0.98,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":399.64905371362386,"score":258.4678841916925,"landed":0.97,"crashed":0.03,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"run":"A_superseded"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:00:46","kind":"stage_pass","gen":5,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","check":{"fitness":409.4703361799543,"score":265.59501909273905,"landed":0.98,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"confirm":{"fitness":399.64905371362386,"score":258.4678841916925,"landed":0.97,"crashed":0.03,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/A/champions/g00005_s0_passed.pkl","run":"A_superseded"},{"t":"2026-10-29 08:00:46","kind":"stage_start","gen":5,"stage_index":1,"stage":"steady push","expect":"The drift sensor should let it lean into a constant push. Risk: landing off the pad downwind.","run":"A_superseded"},{"t":"2026-10-29 07:59:01","title":"Kickoff: NEAT seeded with a cloned pilot","text":"Goal: >= 98% landed between the flags on 1,000 unseen flights with wind 15, turbulence 1.5 and a floating boulder, by Wednesday 4 November 18:00.\n\nBuilt today: the world (wind seeded per flight, the boulder as a static rock, training wheels), a hand-written pilot tuned with CMA-ES (500 unseen flights: calm 100% landed, wind+turbulence 93.8%, with the boulder 74.2%), and a 13-24-4 network cloned from it with DAgger (about 82% landed over mixed worlds). Every genome in NEAT's first population is a copy of that network with small noise; its 24 hidden neurons are protected from deletion.\n\nRun A started: six stages (calm, steady push, gusts, turbulence, boulder, polish). Generation 0 already landed 99% on 100 fresh calm flights.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-29 07:58:06","kind":"new_best","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","check":{"fitness":375.0720695812595,"score":229.32025640954436,"landed":0.99,"crashed":0.01,"boulder":0.0,"timeout":0.0},"champion":"runs/A/champions/g00000_s0_best.pkl","run":"A_superseded"},{"t":"2026-10-29 07:57:20","kind":"run_start","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"note":"NEAT from a cloned teacher network (24 hidden), six stages: calm, steady push, gusts, turbulence, boulder, polish. Training wheels fade in stages 2-4.","run":"A_superseded"},{"t":"2026-10-29 07:57:20","kind":"stage_start","gen":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"calm","expect":"Quick: the cloned network already lands in calm air; NEAT polishes centring. Pass within ~30 generations.","run":"A_superseded"}]